Chapter: HalDeviceDeclared
  cites Foreword chapter Board

 Positive guard for the board HAL. The sanctioned counterpart to
 errors/hal-launder-pure-gpio: a function that drives a GPIO register
 and honestly declares [Device.Mmio] type-checks, so the row-subset
 check passes. The effect is real and declarable, not a blanket ban.

 opening stays pure and never calls it, so the run is deterministic.

Section: Body
  blink : Integer -> [Device.Mmio] Integer
  blink (pin) = gpio-set 1073876992 pin

  opening : Text = "hal-device-declares-ok"
